<section class="bp-section identity" id="collection">
  <div class="bp-inner">
    <div class="top">
      <div>
        <div class="bp-kicker">Same soul · new form</div>
        <h2 class="bp-title">The same character. <span class="cyan">A new way to hold him.</span></h2>
        <div class="bp-copy"><p>Since 2018, BlueMan has carried our lessons and messages to 700K+ people, one picture at a time. Now he steps off the feed and becomes something you can own, make part of your identity, and build with.</p></div>
        <div class="community-stat" aria-label="More than 700,000 people"><strong>700K+</strong><span>PEOPLE</span></div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="shift-box">
          <div class="bp-kicker">The shift</div>
          <div class="bp-copy"><p>Every SuccessPictures drawing was made to explain a feeling to a crowd. Every BlueMan NFT is made to become one person's own — a face, a brand, an identity someone else will recognize as theirs.</p><p>111,111 individually hand-drawn pieces, arriving over 11 years, giving the IP time to grow the way SuccessPictures did — slowly, naturally, and for real.</p><p><strong>From the moment he's yours, BlueMan is no longer just a character we drew. He's one you wake up.</strong> You decide who he becomes, what he stands for, and how many lives he touches from here.</p></div>
        </div>
        <figure class="bp-art bp-tilt-right" style="width:58%;margin:34px auto 0"><img src="data:image/webp;base64," alt="You can shape yourself exactly how you like — original SuccessPictures artwork"></figure>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="nft-story">
      <details><summary>The BlueMan NFT Collection</summary><div class="collection-story"><p><strong>More than an NFT. An IP built to be used.</strong></p>
        <p>Since 2018, SuccessPictures has been creating and sharing original visual content with one simple purpose: to create life-changing AHA moments. What started with a simple idea grew into a global community, built one picture, one message and one AHA moment at a time. Throughout these years, we have continued to create, share and give value simply because we love what we do and believe in the difference it can make. <strong>We create with an open heart and genuine joy, simply because we want to give something meaningful to people, without expecting anything in return.</strong></p>
        <p>Now, we are taking that legacy into the world of NFTs through <strong>BlueMan</strong>.</p>
        <p>BlueMan is built on an established brand, an existing visual language and years of content, recognition and community through SuccessPictures.</p>
        <p>The IP already exists. <strong>The NFT is a new way to own, use and build with it.</strong></p>
        <p>In 2021, we began exploring Web3 — studying how ownership, community and digital identity were evolving, and asking how BlueMan could become part of that shift.</p>
        <p>What followed was falling in love with the Web3 space itself. It resonated with everything we already believed and had already built with SuccessPictures: that people come first, that community is everything, and that soft values are not a weakness, they are a strength.</p>
        <p>Web3 felt like a space where you could succeed by putting people before money.</p>
        <p>This was the same choice we made back in 2018. Web3 simply gave us the tools to invite more people to become part of what we are building and to give even more back to the community that has been part of our journey.</p>
        <p>From that moment on, we began preparing an NFT project for our community, and preparing to bring our SuccessPictures family into Web3, to take part in one of the biggest shifts happening in the world today.</p>
        <p>We have been preparing ever since.</p>
        <p>Since 2018, we have had the opportunity to give people value and create positive change through pictures.</p>
        <p>Today, Web3 and new technologies give us the opportunity to go further. <strong>For the first time, our community can become an active part of what we are building.</strong></p>
        <p>BlueMan gives our community the opportunity to play an active role in the growth of the IP, build with it and help bring the SuccessPictures vision and mission to more people around the world.</p>
        <p>The goal is not simply to grow a collection.</p>
        <p><strong>The goal is to grow the IP, grow the community and grow the impact.</strong></p>
        <p>Every person who builds with BlueMan can become part of that journey. By creating businesses, products, services, communities and ideas around the IP, holders can help take the message further and bring more AHA moments into more people's lives.</p>
        <p>What started with SuccessPictures giving value to people through pictures can now become something the community helps build together.</p>
        <p><strong>We have spent years creating and giving. Now, for the first time, we can build together.</strong></p>
        <h3>111,111 UNIQUE HANDMADE PIECES</h3>
        <p><strong>Created and released over 11 years.</strong></p>
        <p>Every BlueMan piece is individually created by hand.<br>No AI-generated artwork.<br>No automatically generated traits.<br>No mass-produced combinations.</p>
        <p><strong>Every piece is unique.</strong></p>
        <p>111,111 pieces will be created over 11 years, giving the BlueMan IP the time and space to grow, evolve and become something bigger with every passing year.</p>
        <p>With every year, more people become part of the story. With every piece, the story expands. What begins today will continue to evolve for more than a decade, laying the foundation for everything that comes after.</p>
        <p>Because some things are not meant to be rushed. They are meant to be built to last.</p></div></details>
      <div class="nft-row" aria-label="Original BlueMan NFT collection examples">
        <figure class="nft-card"><img src="data:image/webp;base64," alt="Original BlueMan NFT artwork"></figure>
        <figure class="nft-card"><img src="data:image/webp;base64," alt="Original BlueMan NFT artwork"></figure>
