    <div class="numbers">
      <div><div class="bp-kicker">Created and released over 11 years</div><div class="big-number">111,111<span>unique handmade pieces.</span></div></div>
      <div class="bp-copy"><p>Every BlueMan piece is individually created by hand. No AI-generated artwork. No automatically generated traits. No mass-produced combinations.</p><p><strong>Every piece is unique.</strong></p><p>111,111 pieces will be created over 11 years, giving the BlueMan IP the time and space to grow, evolve and become something bigger with every passing year.</p><p><strong>Because some things are not meant to be rushed. They are meant to be built to last.</strong></p></div>
