    <div class="ip-head"><div><div class="bp-kicker">Beyond the marketplace</div><h2 class="bp-title">Built for IP. <span class="cyan">Built for identity.</span></h2></div><div class="bp-copy"><p>BlueMan lives far beyond the marketplace.</p><p>We are building an IP ecosystem that people can build with, and an identity they can make their own.</p><p>The idea is simple: your BlueMan NFT can become part of your identity, your own story, your own brand, your own products, your own services and your own creative world. <strong>You gave him life. Now decide what he does with it.</strong></p></div></div>
    <div class="use-grid">
      <div class="use-item"><div class="use-no">01</div><h3>Physical Products</h3><p>Design and sell your own clothing line, children's books, merchandise, or board games featuring your BlueMan character.</p></div>
