    </div>
    <div class="ip-bottom"><figure class="bp-art bp-tilt-left"><img src="data:image/webp;base64," alt="Your business will never grow bigger than you do — original SuccessPictures artwork"></figure><div><div class="ip-call">Don't just own an NFT. <span>Build with the IP.</span></div><details><summary>Why we're drawing all 111,111 by hand</summary><p>Creating 111,111 unique pieces over 11 years is not the easy way. It is the commitment we chose to make. Because when someone chooses a BlueMan NFT to become part of their identity, we believe we have a responsibility to make it worthy of representing them.</p></details></div></div>
