<section class="bp-section story" id="story">
  <div class="bp-inner">
    <div class="story-head"><div><div class="bp-kicker">Our story</div><h2 class="bp-title">How it all <span class="cyan">started.</span></h2><div class="bp-copy"><p>Our story started in early 2018 with a simple challenge I had: finding a way to express myself to others the way I see things in my mind.</p></div></div><div>
      <details><summary>Communication through pictures</summary><p>The exact pictures we needed did not exist. So the search began for an artist who could understand the ideas and bring the pictures in our minds to life.</p></details>
      <details><summary>The artist who brought the ideas to life</summary><p>Behind every SuccessPictures picture is the same artist who has been there from the beginning. An idea is born. It is shared. And through the artist's hands, it becomes a picture.</p></details>
      <details><summary>One place — SuccessPictures was born</summary><p>In May 2019, SuccessPictures was born: a place to share thoughts, experiences and moments that might mean something to someone else.</p></details>
      <details><summary>A team of three</summary><p>Different people. Different strengths. One shared heart. Together, we continue creating with the hope that something we make today might improve someone's tomorrow.</p></details>
      <details><summary>More than just pictures</summary><p>A picture can travel further than we ever could and reach someone on the other side of the world at exactly the right moment.</p></details>
      <details><summary>People over profit</summary><p>We never wanted the people who trusted us to feel like an audience to be monetized. Trust always comes before money.</p></details>
      <details><summary>The story continues</summary><p>This is a story that is still being written. As long as there are ideas worth sharing and people who need hope, we will keep creating.</p></details>
    </div></div>
    <div class="story-visuals"><figure class="bp-art bp-tilt-left"><img src="data:image/webp;base64," alt="A small word can change somebody's life — original SuccessPictures artwork"></figure><figure class="bp-art"><img src="data:image/webp;base64," alt="Always choose people over money — original SuccessPictures artwork"></figure></div>
  </div>
</section>

